  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91036662a85844eb162bdfbe2ea8ce9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: RussianRules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  displayName: Russian
  description: 8x8 draughts - flying kings, men capture backward, any legal capture is playable, and a newly crowned king keeps capturing that turn.
  longDescription: "<b><color=#D4AF37>Goal:</color></b>\nCapture all of your opponent's pieces, or leave them with no legal move to make.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Board:</color></b>\nPlayed on an 8x8 board. Each player starts with 12 pieces filling the first three rows on their side.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Movement:</color></b>\nMen move diagonally forward only. Kings are flying kings - they slide and capture any distance along a diagonal.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Capturing:</color></b>\nCapturing is mandatory, and men may capture in any diagonal direction, including backward - but any legal capture path may be chosen, with no \"most pieces\" requirement. Captured pieces are removed from the board immediately, which can open up new paths mid-turn.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Kings:</color></b>\nA piece crowns the instant it reaches the back row, even mid-capture, and must immediately keep capturing that same turn using its new king powers.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Win:</color></b>\nCapture every enemy piece, or leave your opponent with no legal move.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Draw:</color></b>\nEither player may offer a draw at any time; if accepted, the match ends level. The match is also drawn if the same position, with the same side to move, repeats three times."
  rows: 8
  columns: 8
  pieceRowsPerSide: 3
  movementScheme: 0
  piecesOnAllSquares: 0
  leaveBackRowEmpty: 0
  flyingKings: 1
  menCaptureBackward: 1
  menCannotCaptureKings: 0
  mustCaptureMaximum: 0
  preferKingMover: 0
  preferKingCaptures: 0
  preferEarlierKingCapture: 0
  midChainPromotionRule: 2
  deferCaptureRemoval: 0
  forbidImmediateReversal: 0
  noProgressMoveLimit: 30
  singleManLosesToKing: 0
